        from the previous scene) can close a popover as it opens, and
        OpenMenu leaves an open one alone, so asking again is safe."""
        for _ in range(2):
            self.bus.call(PANEL, "OpenMenu", GLib.Variant("(s)", (menu,)))
            self.wait(0.7)

